#ASSERT `is a province within section 35(1)` Saskatchewan
#ASSERT `is a province within section 35(1)` Alberta
#ASSERT `is a province within section 35(1)` `British Columbia`
#ASSERT `is a province within section 35(1)` Yukon
#ASSERT `is a province within section 35(1)` `the Northwest Territories`
#ASSERT `is a province within section 35(1)` Nunavut
#ASSERT `the term defined by` (`the definition of the term province`) `covers` "Yukon"
#ASSERT `the term defined by` (`the definition of the term province`) `covers` "a province of Canada"
